{"id":30293,"artist":"Elvis Presley","title":"Viva Las Vegas","lyrics_plain":"Bright light city gonna set my soul\nGonna set my soul on fire\nGot a whole lot of money that's ready to burn\nSo get those stakes up higher\n\nThere's a thousand pretty women waitin' out there\nAnd they're all livin' devil may care\nAnd I'm just the devil with love to spare\nSo Viva Las Vegas, Viva Las Vegas\n\nHow I wish that there were more\nThan the 24 hours in the day\nAnd even if there were 40 more\nI wouldn't sleep a minute away\n\nOh, there's black jack, and poker, and the roulette wheel\nA fortune won and lost on every deal\nAll you need's a strong heart and a nerve of steel\nViva Las Vegas, Viva Las Vegas\n\nViva Las Vegas with your neon flashin'\nAnd your one arm bandits crashin'\nAll those hopes down the drain\nViva Las Vegas turnin' day into nighttime\nAnd turnin' night into daytime\nIf you see it once, you'll never be the same again\n\nI'm gonna keep on the run, I'm gonna have me some fun\nIf it costs me my very last dime\nIf I wind up broke up well\nI'll always remember that I had a swingin' time\nI'm gonna give it everything I've got\nLady luck, please, let the dice stay hot\nAnd let me shoot a seven with every shot\n\nViva Las Vegas, Viva Las Vegas\nViva Las Vega, Viva, Viva Las Vegas","lyrics_synced":"[00:06.67] Bright light city gonna set my soul\n[00:09.29] Gonna set my soul on fire\n[00:12.87] Got a whole lot of money that's ready to burn\n[00:15.85] So get those stakes up higher\n[00:19.13] There's a thousand pretty women waitin' out there\n[00:22.74] And they're all livin' devil may care\n[00:25.90] And I'm just the devil with love to spare\n[00:29.28] So Viva Las Vegas, Viva Las Vegas\n[00:36.24] How I wish that there were more\n[00:39.20] Than the 24 hours in the day\n[00:42.44] And even if there were 40 more\n[00:45.68] I wouldn't sleep a minute away\n[00:48.91] Oh, there's black jack, and poker, and the roulette wheel\n[00:52.46] A fortune won and lost on every d